      <documentation>Standard_B2als_v2 (2 vCPU, 4 GB). Provisionada por Azure CLI (scripts/provision-vm.sh). Entrega de DevOps (Cassio).</documentation>
    </element>
    <element xsi:type="archimate:Node" name="NODE: Docker Engine + Compose v2" id="id-ff153a74f2b340e4b61524faa5feeb3e">
      <documentation>Executa os dois containers integrados (app + db) em background (docker compose up -d).</documentation>
    </element>
    <element xsi:type="archimate:Node" name="NODE: Container app" id="id-07b0ea80a4864eb9a7b0349ad8a0770e">
      <documentation>Imagem multi-stage, usuário não-root, WORKDIR, variáveis de ambiente, porta 8080 exposta.</documentation>
